}+k,\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ is the leading coefficient and $(h,k)$ is the vertex.\n\n- Since $h=-1$ and $k=8,$ the vertex is $(-1,8).$\n\n- Since $a=5>0,$ the parabola opens upwards.\n\nBecause the parabola opens upwards, there is no maximum output, and the vertex corresponds to the minimum output.\n\nTherefore, the range is $[8,\\infty ),$ i.e. $8\\le f(x)<\\infty .$\n\nThe corresponding diagram is shown below.\n\n![](images/7f/7ff6f49b63c4ad55324bbb406558781c9f3e5af3a98d34b285c65f88746bddab.png)"] ["question-ae8713d7-4691-5e08-870e-3fc604e3a336" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-14dd9f6b-b90d-536d-a13a-6a8b2fd1a148" :answer-field/id #uuid "14dd9f6b-b90d-536d-a13a-6a8b2fd1a148"] ["answer-b0550c3e-d926-5110-81d5-70fdbb769ee0" :answer/id #uuid "b0550c3e-d926-5110-81d5-70fdbb769ee0"] ["answer-b0550c3e-d926-5110-81d5-70fdbb769ee0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b0550c3e-d926-5110-81d5-70fdbb769ee0" :answer/value "8"] ["answer-field-14dd9f6b-b90d-536d-a13a-6a8b2fd1a148" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-14dd9f6b-b90d-536d-a13a-6a8b2fd1a148" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-14dd9f6b-b90d-536d-a13a-6a8b2fd1a148" :answer-field/correct "answer-b0550c3e-d926-5110-81d5-70fdbb769ee0"] ["answer-field-14dd9f6b-b90d-536d-a13a-6a8b2fd1a148" :answer-field/choices "answer-b0550c3e-d926-5110-81d5-70fdbb769ee0"] ["answer-field-88ae973c-62f9-56f2-a4a1-2371757dfc39" :answer-field/id #uuid "88ae973c-62f9-56f2-a4a1-2371757dfc39"] ["answer-3b03abe2-8172-576d-97e4-0f4f7c428220" :answer/id #uuid "3b03abe2-8172-576d-97e4-0f4f7c428220"] ["answer-3b03abe2-8172-576d-97e4-0f4f7c428220" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3b03abe2-8172-576d-97e4-0f4f7c428220" :answer/value "<"] ["answer-field-88ae973c-62f9-56f2-a4a1-2371757dfc39" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-88ae973c-62f9-56f2-a4a1-2371757dfc39" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-88ae973c-62f9-56f2-a4a1-2371757dfc39" :answer-field/correct "answer-3b03abe2-8172-576d-97e4-0f4f7c428220"] ["answer-field-88ae973c-62f9-56f2-a4a1-2371757dfc39" :answer-field/choices "answer-3b03abe2-8172-576d-97e4-0f4f7c428220"] ["answer-field-2d759167-da63-50ff-b449-46e9207401d6" :answer-field/id #uuid "2d759167-da63-50ff-b449-46e9207401d6"] ["answer-2cf36b9c-d2df-5984-9e40-401bf59336ca" :answer/id #uuid "2cf36b9c-d2df-5984-9e40-401bf59336ca"] ["answer-2cf36b9c-d2df-5984-9e40-401bf59336ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2cf36b9c-d2df-5984-9e40-401bf59336ca" :answer/value "\\infty"] ["answer-field-2d759167-da63-50ff-b449-46e9207401d6" :answer-field/key "field-3"] ["answer-field-2d759167-da63-50ff-b449-46e9207401d6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-2d759167-da63-50ff-b449-46e9207401d6" :answer-field/correct "answer-2cf36b9c-d2df-5984-9e40-401bf59336ca"] ["answer-field-2d759167-da63-50ff-b449-46e9207401d6" :answer-field/choices "answer-2cf36b9c-d2df-5984-9e40-401bf59336ca"] ["question-ae8713d7-4691-5e08-870e-3fc604e3a336" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-14dd9f6b-b90d-536d-a13a-6a8b2fd1a148"] ["question-ae8713d7-4691-5e08-870e-3fc604e3a336" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-88ae973c-62f9-56f2-a4a1-2371757dfc39"] ["question-ae8713d7-4691-5e08-870e-3fc604e3a336" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-2d759167-da63-50ff-b449-46e9207401d6"] [17592186124584 :knowledge-point/questions "question-ae8713d7-4691-5e08-870e-3fc604e3a336"] [17592186124866 :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)={(x+\\frac{5}{6})}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}?$"] [17592186124866 :question/worked-solution "The parabola is written in vertex form, \n\n$$\ny=a(x-h)^{2}+k,\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ is the leading coefficient and $(h,k)$ is the vertex. \n\n- Since $h=-\\frac{5}{6}$ and $k=-\\frac{1}{2},$ the vertex is $(-\\frac{5}{6},-\\frac{1}{2}).$\n\n- Since $a=1>0,$ the parabola opens upwards.\n\nBecause the parabola opens upwards, there is no maximum output, and the vertex corresponds to the minimum output.\n\nTherefore, the range is $[-\\frac{1}{2},\\infty ).$ \n\n![](images/54/54e0b0ea5dd498a36fc854781dc5120ce1de9bee0c333eecc6d895ce09b72424.png)"] [17592186124866 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-b8a8d8b1-1116-562c-9eac-92b96751313a" :answer/id #uuid "b8a8d8b1-1116-562c-9eac-92b96751313a"] ["answer-b8a8d8b1-1116-562c-9eac-92b96751313a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b8a8d8b1-1116-562c-9eac-92b96751313a" :answer/value "(-\\frac{1}{2},\\infty )"] ["answer-4e47ff5f-6b08-5d07-a62a-c241fb59bdf0" :answer/id #uuid "4e47ff5f-6b08-5d07-a62a-c241fb59bdf0"] ["answer-4e47ff5f-6b08-5d07-a62a-c241fb59bdf0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4e47ff5f-6b08-5d07-a62a-c241fb59bdf0" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-\\frac{1}{2}]"] ["answer-25995585-8181-58ec-9ca2-df6919080cd3" :answer/id #uuid "25995585-8181-58ec-9ca2-df6919080cd3"] ["answer-25995585-8181-58ec-9ca2-df6919080cd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-25995585-8181-58ec-9ca2-df6919080cd3" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,\\frac{5}{6}]"] ["answer-a19b54fd-b859-58ec-9f48-c6622db47056" :answer/id #uuid "a19b54fd-b859-58ec-9f48-c6622db47056"] ["answer-a19b54fd-b859-58ec-9f48-c6622db47056" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a19b54fd-b859-58ec-9f48-c6622db47056" :answer/value "[-\\frac{1}{2},\\infty )"] ["answer-e364e522-0636-5c3f-b534-a21b5528a7bf" :answer/id #uuid "e364e522-0636-5c3f-b534-a21b5528a7bf"] ["answer-e364e522-0636-5c3f-b534-a21b5528a7bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e364e522-0636-5c3f-b534-a21b5528a7bf" :answer/value "[-\\frac{5}{6},\\infty )"] [17592186121796 :answer-field/correct "answer-a19b54fd-b859-58ec-9f48-c6622db47056"] [17592186121796 :answer-field/choices "answer-b8a8d8b1-1116-562c-9eac-92b96751313a"] [17592186121796 :answer-field/choices "answer-4e47ff5f-6b08-5d07-a62a-c241fb59bdf0"] [17592186121796 :answer-field/choices "answer-25995585-8181-58ec-9ca2-df6919080cd3"] [17592186121796 :answer-field/choices "answer-a19b54fd-b859-58ec-9f48-c6622db47056"] [17592186121796 :answer-field/choices "answer-e364e522-0636-5c3f-b534-a21b5528a7bf"] ["question-a24bba0b-6082-5434-98a9-2578424db732" :question/id #uuid "a24bba0b-6082-5434-98a9-2578424db732"] ["question-a24bba0b-6082-5434-98a9-2578424db732" :question/math-academy-id "q-106279"] ["question-a24bba0b-6082-5434-98a9-2578424db732" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)=\\frac{1}{2}(x-8)^{2}-18?$"] ["question-a24bba0b-6082-5434-98a9-2578424db732" :question/worked-solution "The parabola is written in vertex form, \n\n$$\ny=a(x-h)^{2}+k,\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ is the leading coefficient and $(h,k)$ is the vertex. \n\n- Since $h=8$ and $k=-18,$ the vertex is $(8,-18).$\n\n- Since $a=\\frac{1}{2}>0,$ the parabola opens upwards.\n\nBecause the parabola opens upwards, there is no maximum output, and the vertex corresponds to the minimum output. \n\nTherefore, the range is $[-18,\\infty ).$\n\nThe corresponding diagram is shown below.\n\n![](images/a1/a115822cf26b79f0b25ed5493f5951c71c02c6ef5a4d576d101b4bc580d5da9f.png)"] ["question-a24bba0b-6082-5434-98a9-2578424db732" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-c7d9884e-0ead-53ae-8a5b-cde350ebf44a" :answer-field/id #uuid "c7d9884e-0ead-53ae-8a5b-cde350ebf44a"] ["answer-3a31478e-4c7c-5de1-8fad-3638ee4a8f27" :answer/id #uuid "3a31478e-4c7c-5de1-8fad-3638ee4a8f27"] ["answer-3a31478e-4c7c-5de1-8fad-3638ee4a8f27" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3a31478e-4c7c-5de1-8fad-3638ee4a8f27" :answer/value "[-18,\\infty )"] ["answer-8a2b0a49-4051-52d2-805a-b79331b4101a" :answer/id #uuid "8a2b0a49-4051-52d2-805a-b79331b4101a"] ["answer-8a2b0a49-4051-52d2-805a-b79331b4101a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8a2b0a49-4051-52d2-805a-b79331b4101a" :answer/value "[-8,\\infty )"] ["answer-d9c83282-9161-5639-be3f-86063ce871cd" :answer/id #uuid "d9c83282-9161-5639-be3f-86063ce871cd"] ["answer-d9c83282-9161-5639-be3f-86063ce871cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d9c83282-9161-5639-be3f-86063ce871cd" :a